Improve analyst-recommendation coverage**  \n   - Add a reliable fallback source when MarketWatch is blocked by anti-bot/JS.\n\n3. **Standardize the Dow “blue chips” basket**  \n   - Define a fixed watchlist for consistency across daily cron outputs.\n\n4. **Clarify data freshness in output**  \n   - Always label whether each equity quote is intraday vs last close to avoid ambiguity.\n\n5. **Optional quality upgrade**  \n   - Build a reusable template for this cron output so formatting and source-fallback notes are uniform every run.\n\n---\n\n## 5) Important context to remember 🧠\n\n- Original task constraints were strict:\n  - Yahoo must **not** be sole source.\n  - Use at least 2 among: MarketWatch, CNBC, Investing, TradingView, Stooq.\n  - If missing data: state **“non disponible” + source tentée**.\n  - Send output to Telegram topic bourse: `-1003791371950:3`.\n  - After sending, return only `NO_REPLY`.\n- In this environment, Telegram topic delivery worked with:\n  - `target = -1003791371950`\n  - `threadId = 3`\n- Relevant memory note surfaced in context:\n  - `post-fix check LanceDB memory_store functional` (memory subsystem noted as functioning).","textSignature":"msg_0ad999022df2abe201698fa584a4a08191b20cfe1cc80e565e"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.3-codex","usage":{"input":511,"output":915,"cacheRead":57088,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":58514,"cost":{"input":0.00089425,"output":0.01281,"cacheRead":0.0099904,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.023694649999999998}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1771021698194}}
